      "decision": "The authenticated full-file source transition and current token census identify these exact public InjectionToken constructor roles: MAT_LEGACY_DIALOG_DATA constructed with literal MatDialogData at line 30; MAT_LEGACY_DIALOG_DEFAULT_OPTIONS constructed with literal mat-dialog-default-options at line 35; MAT_LEGACY_DIALOG_SCROLL_STRATEGY constructed with literal mat-dialog-scroll-strategy at line 42. The three legacy dialog tokens remain separately constructed and retain their prior literal descriptions; their provider graph and native dialog behavior remain separate. The source inventory reconciles all 25 imports and all 27 current constructions against the prior named roles: one historical local progress-default construction was replaced with the public peer alias, while the distinct legacy animation-mode construction was added; equal counts are not identity proof. The untouched 16.2.14 tagged source and SRI-verified package show that original legacy progress exported and injected the same nonlegacy progress token; current 22.1.7 public Injector and extracted defaults-branch protocols support that alias. Native component factories/rendering, ambient motion, consumer artifacts, advertised runtime floors, security and G11 remain separate."
    },
